{"type":"message","id":"e97062d9","parentId":"a63cf984","timestamp":"2026-05-17T00:27:16.830Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still 500. The Cloudflare Workers error 1101 seems to be a platform issue. This could mean the Workers script itself has an error in the /send handler. Let me try a GET on /status or similar endpoint, or try different API approaches.\n\nLet me try:\n1. POST with empty body first\n2. Different endpoint\n3. Check if /send endpoint expects different parameters\n\nActually, the error \"1101\" from Cloudflare typically means \"Worker threw exception\" or similar. This means the Workers script is crashing on the /send endpoint.\n\nLet me check if there's a different endpoint format or if the content is causing issues. Let me try a very simple message first.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-cc0b09c1-2d3c-49af-b175-eeffc41904bb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try minimal message\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"heartbeat test\"}' -w \"\\nHTTP: %{http_code}\\n\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-96ea7d1a-9458-4b35-ab23-231c8f54ecd4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check if there's a /status or /health endpoint\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/status\" -w \"\\nHTTP: %{http_code}\\n\"\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/health\" -w \"\\nHTTP: %{http_code}\\n\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1282,"output":340,"cacheRead":19872,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21494,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778977627045,"responseId":"chatcmpl-757725c5-21d9-