{"type":"message","id":"84f2d1eb","parentId":"070755e2","timestamp":"2026-05-17T00:27:23.372Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So:\n- GET /status returns \"Unauthorized\" with 401\n- GET /health returns \"OK\" with 200\n\nThe /send endpoint is failing with 500 (1101 Cloudflare error). This indicates the Worker itself has an issue with the /send route handler. This is a platform-side issue.\n\nLet me report this to the user - the platform is accessible for reads but the /send POST endpoint is returning Cloudflare Worker errors (500/1101). I should inform the user about this.\n\nThe heartbeat I tried to send for 00:25 UTC didn't go through due to the platform issue. I should report this status.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 00:25 UTC Heartbeat 报告**\n\n✅ **检查完成** — 双线程读取正常，无人类讨论待响应\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|-------------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC | ✅ 无新讨论 |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC | ✅ 无新讨论 |\n\n⚠️ **问题：** `POST /send` 返回 Cloudflare 500 (error 1101 — Worker异常)，heartbeat写入失败。平台 `/health` 返回200但 `/send` 路由崩溃。建议检查 Workers 脚本中 `send` handler 的实现（可能是JSON解析或KV写入异常）。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":645,"output":279,"cacheRead":20896,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21820,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778977637152,"responseId":"chatcmpl-31adc238-1cf7-41f9-8685-48ff01d5dd34"}}
